{#-
  One merchandising block on the catalogue front page. Expects `block` to be set
  by the caller ({% set block = ... %} or a {% for %} over shopBlocks).

  Four shapes, chosen by block.layout (see src/content/shop-blocks.js): the page
  used to render five identical grids under five identical headings, which meant
  a hand-picked product carried exactly as much weight as the brand list.

  An empty block renders nothing at all — that is what lets "lo más vendido" ship
  enabled on a shop with no orders yet and simply appear the day it has some.
-#}
{%- if block.enabled and block.items.length %}
<section class="shop-block shop-block-{{ block.layout }} reveal" aria-labelledby="shop-block-{{ block.name }}">
  <div class="shop-block-head">
    <h2 class="shop-block-title" id="shop-block-{{ block.name }}">{{ block.title }}</h2>
    {#- There is no separate "all products" page: the full grid lives further
        down this same page, so the link is an anchor to it. -#}
    {%- if block.layout == "showcase" %}
    <a href="#product-browse" class="shop-block-more">Ver todo el catálogo ↓</a>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>

  {%- if block.layout == "showcase" %}
  {#- The lead blocks: fewer, bigger cards, so a featured product does not read
      as one more row of the 60-item grid below.

      Under three items there is no showcase to make — big cards would just leave
      two empty columns under the heading, which reads as broken rather than
      short. This is not hypothetical: a shop with its first confirmed order has
      exactly one best seller. -#}
  <div class="product-grid{% if block.items.length >= 3 %} product-grid-lg{% endif %}">
    {%- for product in block.items %}
    {% include "product-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  {%- elif block.layout == "strip" %}
  {#- New arrivals are a browse-past list, not a shortlist: one scrollable row
      keeps a long tail from pushing the rest of the page down. -#}
  <div class="product-strip">
    {%- for product in block.items %}
    {% include "product-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  {%- elif block.layout == "mosaic" %}
  <div class="category-grid">
    {%- for group in block.items %}
    <a href="{{ group.url }}" class="category-card">
      <span class="category-card-image">
        <img src="{{ group.image_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/img/placeholder-product.svg';">
      </span>
      <span class="category-card-body">
        <span class="category-card-label">{{ group.label }}</span>
        <span class="category-card-count">{{ group.total }} producto{% if group.total != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  {%- else %}
  <div class="brand-strip">
    {%- for group in block.items %}
    <a href="{{ group.url }}" class="brand-chip">{{ group.label }} <span class="brand-chip-count">{{ group.total }}</span></a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
{%- endif %}
